    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Stunning Sky Environment</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2561860/extras/20c1386230ec4820659235df6d096ffa.avif?t=1694429224\" /></span><br>Immerse yourself in a vibrant and captivating sky world that keeps you engaged and motivated throughout your language-learning adventure. Dynamic visuals and atmospheric effects ensure your learning experience is anything but dull.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Kanji Pathways</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2561860/extras/48db421250c1f5e3b1a85b1148014a57.avif?t=1694429224\" /></span><br>The path ahead isn't always clear \u2013 unlock your way forward by deciphering Kanji characters displayed on each platform. Match the character's meaning or reading to progress, and watch as the sky bridges form before your eyes.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Kanji Cards</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2561860/extras/522b10761e27973e06a9a730d6641d1e.avif?t=1694429224\" /></span><br>Discover Kanji cards that provide essential information about each character. These cards offer insights into stroke order, meanings, and example common words using the Kanji, enhancing your learning experience while you play.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hiragana and Katakana Mastery</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2561860/extras/89ac8cbcef2a8c90ada5ce7ad9968166.avif?t=1694429224\" /></span><br>Hone your skills in the foundational scripts of hiragana and katakana. Master these essential Japanese scripts as part of your main journey, ensuring a strong linguistic foundation.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Collection Showcase</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2561860/extras/397b642b887478217e9f1b25cf04db58.avif?t=1694429224\" /></span><br>Track your progress and showcase your linguistic achievements in a dedicated collection. Review all the characters you've learned so far, reinforcing your knowledge and inspiring your journey.",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Stunning Sky Environment</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2561860/extras/20c1386230ec4820659235df6d096ffa.avif?t=1694429224\" /></span><br>Immerse yourself in a vibrant and captivating sky world that keeps you engaged and motivated throughout your language-learning adventure. Dynamic visuals and atmospheric effects ensure your learning experience is anything but dull.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Kanji Pathways</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2561860/extras/48db421250c1f5e3b1a85b1148014a57.avif?t=1694429224\" /></span><br>The path ahead isn't always clear \u2013 unlock your way forward by deciphering Kanji characters displayed on each platform. Match the character's meaning or reading to progress, and watch as the sky bridges form before your eyes.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Kanji Cards</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2561860/extras/522b10761e27973e06a9a730d6641d1e.avif?t=1694429224\" /></span><br>Discover Kanji cards that provide essential information about each character. These cards offer insights into stroke order, meanings, and example common words using the Kanji, enhancing your learning experience while you play.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hiragana and Katakana Mastery</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2561860/extras/89ac8cbcef2a8c90ada5ce7ad9968166.avif?t=1694429224\" /></span><br>Hone your skills in the foundational scripts of hiragana and katakana. Master these essential Japanese scripts as part of your main journey, ensuring a strong linguistic foundation.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Collection Showcase</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2561860/extras/397b642b887478217e9f1b25cf04db58.avif?t=1694429224\" /></span><br>Track your progress and showcase your linguistic achievements in a dedicated collection. Review all the characters you've learned so far, reinforcing your knowledge and inspiring your journey.",
